# HTML & CSS rules

## HTML pages

- One file per section at repo root; share nav, footer, and meta patterns with `index.html`
- Bootstrap 4 grid (`container`, `row`, `col-*`)
- CDN assets must include `integrity` and `crossorigin` where already used
- Script tag for app JS (do not change filename manually):

```html
<script defer type="text/javascript" src="assets/js/scripts-{timestamp}.js"></script>
```

## CSS

- `assets/css/main.css` — layout, typography, components, responsive rules
- `assets/css/animations.css` — transitions and keyframe animations only
- Extend Bootstrap; avoid overriding core Bootstrap class names unnecessarily
- Prefer existing colour/spacing variables and class names before adding new ones

## Images

- Store under `assets/images/` in existing subfolders (`backgrounds/`, `masjid/`, `posters/`, `team/`, etc.)
- Use descriptive `alt` text for accessibility
- Optimise file size before adding large images

## Accessibility

- Semantic headings (`h1` once per page)
- `lang="en-GB"` on `<html>`
- Sufficient colour contrast; don't rely on colour alone for meaning
